WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:05.888
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.291 --> 00:00:10.159
Delivers this message

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:19.162
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.305 --> 00:00:20.772
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.772 --> 00:00:28.880
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.175
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.414 --> 00:00:36.684
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:41.052
But please don't look back

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:45.220
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:49.526
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.801 --> 00:00:53.237
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.505 --> 00:00:57.407
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.809 --> 00:01:01.472
Delivers this message

00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:10.150
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.522 --> 00:01:18.725
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.164 --> 00:01:28.835
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:35.209
After the day of the inquiry, people's
views of Shurei changed completely.

00:01:35.981 --> 00:01:39.644
There was no longer a single
person who doubted her ability.

00:01:40.585 --> 00:01:42.815
With the Swearing-in Ceremony
only a few days away...

00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:47.153
...Shurei, as usual, was intent
on preparing the evening meal.

00:01:47.425 --> 00:01:52.385
Send Your Dear Child on a Voyage

00:01:55.967 --> 00:01:59.562
Okay? So, please let me
stay here again, Princess.

00:02:00.005 --> 00:02:02.667
You intend to stay here
even if I say no, don't you?

00:02:03.642 --> 00:02:05.109
You got that right.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.974
So someone this small has become
the Jogen this time, huh?

00:02:12.917 --> 00:02:14.680
Quite amazing.

00:02:15.954 --> 00:02:18.184
I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:02:18.256 --> 00:02:21.248
I'm Eigetsu To.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:21.326 --> 00:02:26.423
Oh? That's a good greeting.
I'm Ensei Ro. Pleased to meet you.

00:02:26.498 --> 00:02:28.159
Ensei Ro?!

00:02:28.233 --> 00:02:29.791
You're the one
who was selected...

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:33.395
...to be governor of Sa Province without
even taking the National Exams, right?

00:02:33.471 --> 00:02:36.099
More accurately,
never mind the National Exams...

00:02:36.174 --> 00:02:39.473
...he hasn't even passed the qualifying
exam necessary to be a regional official.

00:02:39.811 --> 00:02:41.278
Really?

00:02:44.215 --> 00:02:45.079
What is it?

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:48.210
I managed to pass the
qualifying exam for Sa Province.

00:02:48.653 --> 00:02:50.883
Congratulations!
That's great!

00:02:50.955 --> 00:02:51.944
Yeah.

00:02:52.023 --> 00:02:55.652
I have never studied
so hard in my entire life.

00:02:55.727 --> 00:02:57.888
Hey, ask me where I ranked!

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.862
You must've done well, then.
Where did you rank?

00:03:00.932 --> 00:03:02.559
Second from the bottom!

00:03:06.638 --> 00:03:10.165
My Lady. Eigetsu.
Let me discard this man somewhere.

00:03:10.241 --> 00:03:13.836
H-H-Hey! Passing's what counts!
Passing!

00:03:13.912 --> 00:03:16.540
Whether you pass at the top
or the bottom, you're still an official!

00:03:16.614 --> 00:03:18.809
Just try and tell an official
who passed with top marks...

00:03:18.883 --> 00:03:22.319
...that the former Governor of Sa
Province was second from the bottom.

00:03:22.387 --> 00:03:24.878
They'll despair for the world and
immediately enter a monastery.

00:03:24.956 --> 00:03:28.756
- Wow. I've never seen
Mr. Seiran like this.
- Passing first time is something in itself!

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:33.320
- He's only like that with Ensei.
- If you had failed, becoming monks
wouldn't have saved them.

00:03:33.398 --> 00:03:34.626
Honestly!

00:03:34.699 --> 00:03:37.133
Well, I'm going out for a bit.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.197
Ah, right. Princess.

00:03:40.271 --> 00:03:41.363
What is it?

00:03:41.439 --> 00:03:46.604
I have someone with me this time.
Would you mind seeing her?

00:03:47.345 --> 00:03:48.937
Who is it?

00:03:49.414 --> 00:03:50.938
Miss Korin.

00:03:51.683 --> 00:03:55.244
Korin?! Wow, that brings
back memories! I'd love to see her!

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:58.312
Well, it seems she has various
errands to take care of...

00:03:59.023 --> 00:04:01.082
...so I'll bring her when
things have calmed down.

00:04:01.159 --> 00:04:02.285
Sure.

00:04:03.361 --> 00:04:05.795
Please set aside
some food for me, too.

00:04:07.499 --> 00:04:09.023
See you later.

00:04:16.741 --> 00:04:18.641
This is very poorly made.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.871
So, this is what that old man
commissioned in such a hurry...

00:04:20.945 --> 00:04:23.140
...and hid under his toupee, huh?

00:04:23.214 --> 00:04:25.182
Then it really is a fake.

00:04:25.316 --> 00:04:27.341
Well, we figured as much.

00:04:27.986 --> 00:04:30.978
So, the ring Senior Secretary Sai was
said to have lost in the first place...

00:04:31.055 --> 00:04:32.716
...hasn't been found yet?

00:04:32.791 --> 00:04:35.055
We do have people
out searching for it, though.

00:04:35.527 --> 00:04:38.655
The question is whether
that one's real or not.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:42.197
You've got quite the collection here.

00:04:42.267 --> 00:04:46.260
They're the items Senior Secretary
Sai collected to use as bribes.

00:04:46.404 --> 00:04:47.666
What's this?

00:04:52.143 --> 00:04:54.737
It's the portrait of
Senior Secretary Sai's daughter...

00:04:54.813 --> 00:04:57.441
...whom he was trying to get
Koyu to take for a wife.

00:04:57.782 --> 00:04:59.750
You passed on
a great opportunity, I must say.

00:04:59.818 --> 00:05:01.581
Shut up!

00:05:01.653 --> 00:05:03.143
What is it?

00:05:03.221 --> 00:05:04.688
Found it!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.585
I had it brought from
Senior Secretary Sai's residence.

00:05:12.096 --> 00:05:16.863
- What do you think?
- Extremely well made... but fake.

00:05:19.437 --> 00:05:22.201
Having it stolen so
openly by his daughter...

00:05:22.273 --> 00:05:25.401
...and then having her portrait
done without even noticing.

00:05:25.477 --> 00:05:27.945
Wow, that's quite
the laughable family.

00:05:28.012 --> 00:05:32.039
But in that case,
just where is the real one?

00:05:32.617 --> 00:05:34.915
I'll have them continue searching.

00:05:36.621 --> 00:05:38.714
This was a close call.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.655
If it had gotten to
the Sa Clan main house...

00:05:40.725 --> 00:05:42.716
...anyone would have
believed it was real.

00:05:42.794 --> 00:05:44.887
How are things currently
in Sa Province?

00:05:45.263 --> 00:05:48.630
Ever since Enjun passed away,
the Sa Clan...

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.828
...has been in a state of disarray
as people fight for the leadership.

00:05:53.004 --> 00:05:57.373
Everyone's searching frantically
for the Sa Clan leader's ring.

00:05:58.042 --> 00:06:00.738
It's been almost
a year since Enjun died.

00:06:01.479 --> 00:06:05.540
In cases where one full year passes
without the leader's ring being found...

00:06:05.617 --> 00:06:09.849
...it is allowable to install a provisional
leader and have a new ring made.

00:06:10.955 --> 00:06:12.650
There'd be nothing
more troublesome...

00:06:12.724 --> 00:06:15.386
...than to have some dubious
character end up as leader.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:18.429
And it's the people who would end up
getting caught in the fallout.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:21.760
In Sa Province, the authority
of the Sa Clan is absolute.

00:06:22.133 --> 00:06:25.000
If anyone is to counter them,
it can only be a proper governor...

00:06:25.069 --> 00:06:27.037
...with the full backing of the king.

00:06:27.338 --> 00:06:28.862
I know.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.704
First, I want your consent.

00:06:32.677 --> 00:06:36.579
Those against my recommendation
regarding the Governor of Sa Province?

00:06:52.897 --> 00:06:55.866
Kuro, you've always been
very skilled in many things.

00:06:55.934 --> 00:07:00.462
With awkward me and insolently
smug Reishin as older brothers...

00:07:01.039 --> 00:07:04.497
...you ended up being able
to do everything on your own.

00:07:04.576 --> 00:07:07.204
What do they call it?

00:07:07.278 --> 00:07:09.473
That's right!
The capable poor.

00:07:09.981 --> 00:07:12.245
Just what about me is poor?

00:07:12.317 --> 00:07:16.219
It's a saying.
Unlike Reishin, you're serious...

00:07:16.287 --> 00:07:18.414
...so others rely on you
and you often end up...

00:07:18.489 --> 00:07:20.047
...getting the short end
of the stick.

00:07:20.124 --> 00:07:22.490
Although I'm the
one responsible for that.

00:07:23.628 --> 00:07:26.688
Since I abandoned the
responsibilities of the eldest child...

00:07:26.764 --> 00:07:30.165
...all of Father's expectations
fell on you.

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:35.202
Also because Reishin wasn't the type
of child that would listen to Father.

00:07:35.707 --> 00:07:38.505
I caused you
a lot of loneliness, didn't I?

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.239
Not really.

00:07:41.713 --> 00:07:46.707
I was fortunate not to have to see such
a dimwitted older brother like you.

00:07:47.885 --> 00:07:49.716
You may be right.

00:07:50.154 --> 00:07:52.645
I hate you.

00:07:52.724 --> 00:07:56.717
But, even now, I still regret...

00:07:56.794 --> 00:07:59.627
...not being able to stop what
happened here in this residence...

00:07:59.697 --> 00:08:01.927
...when Elder Sister Shokun died.

00:08:03.735 --> 00:08:06.363
But you were
in distant Hong Province.

00:08:06.437 --> 00:08:11.898
The servants I assigned
to you were like bald eagles.

00:08:12.577 --> 00:08:17.037
They spotted valuables and Elder
Sister's keepsakes, and robbed you...

00:08:17.115 --> 00:08:19.083
...while you were in shock
from her death.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:21.948
It's my fault for having
been in such a daze.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:27.550
That's exactly why Elder Brother Rei and
I were supposed to be watching over you!

00:08:28.426 --> 00:08:32.123
After everything had happened,
about the only thing I was able to do...

00:08:32.196 --> 00:08:34.756
...was to hunt down
every last one of them...

00:08:34.832 --> 00:08:38.029
...and show them a living hell
worse than death.

00:08:41.906 --> 00:08:44.238
It's not like I lost everything.

00:08:44.308 --> 00:08:48.904
The most important things
are where no one can steal them.

00:08:51.683 --> 00:08:53.446
I'm sorry.

00:08:53.918 --> 00:08:59.550
You came here to say that to me,
didn't you? You're too kind.

00:08:59.957 --> 00:09:02.050
What do you mean by that?

00:09:02.593 --> 00:09:04.083
Ah, well, um...!

00:09:04.162 --> 00:09:08.622
Don't take me for some fool! It would
be the end of me if you felt sorry for me.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.695
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:10.768 --> 00:09:13.794
I came here for
Koyu and Shurei's sake.

00:09:15.006 --> 00:09:19.466
Someday, Koyu is to take Shurei as
his wife and take over the Hong clan.

00:09:20.478 --> 00:09:25.745
I won't oppose it, but that
won't come up for a while yet.

00:09:27.185 --> 00:09:28.618
You intend to let her go?!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.618
No doubt, that child will say yes.

00:09:35.293 --> 00:09:36.920
Hakumei Heki

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:51.467
Being king is a difficult job.

00:09:58.716 --> 00:10:02.675
Shurei Hong

00:10:04.789 --> 00:10:06.757
Shurei.

00:10:12.196 --> 00:10:15.654
Today is the last day
I'll ever wear this Initiate's uniform.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.974
Now, I wonder
where we're all headed.

00:10:32.049 --> 00:10:34.517
I'll definitely be sent to
the central administration.

00:10:34.619 --> 00:10:38.680
If possible, I'd prefer to be assigned
a regional post. What about you, Shurei?

00:10:38.856 --> 00:10:40.824
It doesn't matter where.

00:10:41.192 --> 00:10:43.820
After all, what we have to do
is the same wherever we are.

00:10:43.895 --> 00:10:45.362
That's right.

00:10:45.429 --> 00:10:48.455
Official Ro...
ah, Senior Secretary Ro.

00:10:48.533 --> 00:10:51.434
It's all right.
They're both the same.

00:10:52.737 --> 00:10:55.103
What Initiate Hong said is true.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:59.533
Regardless of what position
or location you're assigned to...

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:02.670
...it doesn't change what you
have to do in the least.

00:11:03.214 --> 00:11:08.174
For what reason do officials exist?
Ask yourself that.

00:11:08.252 --> 00:11:11.779
If you do, you'll naturally realize
for yourself what you must do.

00:11:14.325 --> 00:11:18.523
Now, you are about to take
your first steps as officials!

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.597
Yes!

00:11:21.098 --> 00:11:26.058
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:32.300
Hakumei Heki. You will be a junior
official in the Ministry of State Affairs...

00:11:32.376 --> 00:11:34.810
...Department of Civil Affairs.
- Yes!

00:11:35.479 --> 00:11:37.845
The same department as Koyu,
whom he respects so much.

00:11:37.915 --> 00:11:39.382
How wonderful for him!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:43.386
Civil Affairs is challenging, but
Senior Secretary Ro's report indicates...

00:11:43.454 --> 00:11:46.287
...that you should readily meet
that challenge.

00:11:46.357 --> 00:11:48.120
We're counting on you.

00:11:48.192 --> 00:11:50.160
I most humbly accept.

00:11:56.434 --> 00:12:00.734
Lastly, Initiate To and Initiate Hong.
Come forward.

00:12:02.506 --> 00:12:04.474
Why? Both of us together?

00:12:15.119 --> 00:12:21.251
Eigetsu To, this year's Jogen,
and Shurei Hong, this year's Tanka...

00:12:21.893 --> 00:12:25.795
...you are both to be assigned
as governors of Sa Province.

00:12:28.366 --> 00:12:31.631
Y-Your Majesty! You're suddenly
entrusting these two complete novices...

00:12:31.702 --> 00:12:35.229
...with a position next in rank
to the leader of one of the ministries?!

00:12:35.306 --> 00:12:37.103
What in the world are you thinking?!

00:12:37.174 --> 00:12:39.438
Not to mention two people
at the same time!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.978
Since they are still each only capable
of doing the job of half a person...

00:12:42.046 --> 00:12:44.776
...we thought that the two of them
together would be just about right.

00:12:44.849 --> 00:12:46.373
J-Just about right?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.681
Well, then, will you go forth
as Governor of Sa Province?

00:12:51.756 --> 00:12:54.316
Are there any here who believe
they're fit for the position?!

00:12:57.128 --> 00:13:01.497
There was also a dispute before
the last governor was chosen.

00:13:01.666 --> 00:13:04.464
And in the end,
an unknown young man...

00:13:04.535 --> 00:13:07.595
...who hadn't even passed
the National Exams was sent.

00:13:07.672 --> 00:13:10.106
Despite having neither
rank nor experience...

00:13:10.174 --> 00:13:13.166
...he carried out his duties as
Governor of Sa Province admirably.

00:13:13.244 --> 00:13:18.204
But that's because the extremely
capable Official Tei was his assistant.

00:13:18.282 --> 00:13:20.250
Certainly that was a major factor.

00:13:20.451 --> 00:13:23.249
And so, we'll be assigning
assistants this time as well.

00:13:23.554 --> 00:13:27.513
As there are two new leaders, we'll
be assigning two assistants as well!

00:13:27.825 --> 00:13:31.852
One is Lieutenant Governor Tei,
who will remain at his current post.

00:13:32.263 --> 00:13:35.721
The other is... Ensei Ro.
Come forward.

00:13:36.567 --> 00:13:37.727
Yes!

00:13:39.904 --> 00:13:42.702
As the previous Governor
of Sa Province...

00:13:42.773 --> 00:13:45.469
...no doubt you will be able
to guide them well.

00:13:45.543 --> 00:13:48.011
Accompany these two
and go forth to Sa Province.

00:13:48.546 --> 00:13:50.844
I humbly accept this appointment.

00:13:51.716 --> 00:13:54.549
And because of Sa Province's
unusual circumstances...

00:13:54.618 --> 00:13:58.714
...a military officer will be specially
assigned exclusively to them.

00:13:58.789 --> 00:14:00.279
Seiran Si!

00:14:00.958 --> 00:14:01.947
Yes.

00:14:02.026 --> 00:14:04.893
You're to be assigned
as their exclusive officer.

00:14:06.063 --> 00:14:09.624
That authority shall be higher
than that of a provincial general.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:14.000
Together, proceed to Sa Province,
and assist the two new governors.

00:14:14.405 --> 00:14:16.566
Kansho. Bakuya.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:19.905
The twin swords that my highly
esteemed elder brother wielded.

00:14:20.711 --> 00:14:23.805
Kansho and Bakuya were
forged from the same ore...

00:14:23.881 --> 00:14:29.080
...and even though he was given both,
Elder Brother Seien gave me Bakuya.

00:14:30.187 --> 00:14:33.918
At that time, I was too young
to even carry it properly...

00:14:35.192 --> 00:14:37.387
...but Bakuya is my treasure.

00:14:37.928 --> 00:14:40.590
And I hereby present you
with the twin sword...

00:14:41.232 --> 00:14:43.860
...Kansho, that Elder
Brother Seien wielded.

00:14:44.468 --> 00:14:46.436
You are worthy of this.

00:14:58.983 --> 00:15:01.417
I most humbly accept.

00:15:06.223 --> 00:15:10.023
And finally, Initiate To
and Initiate Hong, I ask you.

00:15:11.062 --> 00:15:13.963
As you know, Sa Province
is a dangerous region.

00:15:14.298 --> 00:15:16.289
While we intend to do
all we can to protect you...

00:15:16.367 --> 00:15:18.665
...we can't guarantee your safety.

00:15:18.736 --> 00:15:23.173
With that in mind,
will you still go forth as governor?

00:15:23.641 --> 00:15:24.972
I'll go!

00:15:27.812 --> 00:15:29.973
I humbly accept this post.

00:15:32.016 --> 00:15:35.952
In that case, I entrust you with the charm
and seal of the Governor of Sa Province.

00:15:37.121 --> 00:15:40.215
You can understand that we could
not make two of each of these...

00:15:41.358 --> 00:15:43.519
...so you shall each
carry one of the two.

00:15:43.794 --> 00:15:46.490
In other words, the two of you
together are the governor.

00:15:46.564 --> 00:15:50.500
Unprecedented.
It's the birth of co-governors.

00:15:50.768 --> 00:15:54.329
And I have one more gift for you.

00:15:55.106 --> 00:15:57.734
A flower from me to the two of you.

00:16:00.111 --> 00:16:02.511
A flower is proof of absolute trust.

00:16:02.913 --> 00:16:06.849
Until now, the only ones
to receive flowers are Koyu and I.

00:16:13.724 --> 00:16:14.748
Buds.

00:16:14.825 --> 00:16:17.794
Its meaning is infinite
possibility and hope.

00:16:18.529 --> 00:16:22.226
We're looking forward to seeing
how you make them bloom.

00:16:23.601 --> 00:16:26.001
When those buds have
opened beautifully...

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:29.096
...at that time,
I'll present a flower in full blossom.

00:16:29.173 --> 00:16:32.301
In other words,
this indicates that these two...

00:16:32.376 --> 00:16:35.106
...are expected to support the king
and the nation in the future.

00:16:35.179 --> 00:16:39.275
This means that those who seek to harm
these two are enemies of the king.

00:16:53.931 --> 00:16:57.230
Sa Province... I wonder
what it's like there.

00:16:58.802 --> 00:17:00.360
Shurei!

00:17:04.341 --> 00:17:06.070
What are you doing here?!

00:17:06.477 --> 00:17:09.275
I told you before that
I wanted to talk to you...

00:17:09.346 --> 00:17:11.007
...after your assignment
was decided.

00:17:27.831 --> 00:17:29.298
Shurei.

00:17:31.669 --> 00:17:34.137
I had a very hard time
making this decision.

00:17:36.173 --> 00:17:38.971
They say,
"Send your dear child on a voyage"...

00:17:39.944 --> 00:17:42.640
...but the truth is I didn't want
to have you go to Sa Province.

00:17:43.414 --> 00:17:49.148
You will never understand how
I felt as I wrote down your name.

00:17:50.054 --> 00:17:52.454
The truth is I wanted you
to be by my side.

00:17:54.191 --> 00:17:58.958
You're more than able
to do things without me now.

00:17:59.697 --> 00:18:04.361
Isn't that right? And not only because
Koyu and General Ran are with you.

00:18:05.102 --> 00:18:09.539
While I hate to admit it,
right now, you really don't need me.

00:18:09.607 --> 00:18:10.801
You're wrong!

00:18:15.846 --> 00:18:19.612
I've said it many times.
That you're very dear to me.

00:18:19.683 --> 00:18:24.484
By that, I mean I don't want you
below me. I want you by my side.

00:18:27.625 --> 00:18:30.093
- I can't do that.
- I know.

00:18:31.395 --> 00:18:35.331
I don't hope for that much right now.
But I want you to remember...

00:18:35.799 --> 00:18:38.597
...that I have no intention of taking
anyone other than you as my wife.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.768
- That's impossible.
- Why?

00:18:41.839 --> 00:18:46.435
I can't become a consort.
I'm striving for something different.

00:18:48.746 --> 00:18:50.008
Shurei.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.604
Do you care about me?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:57.917
I do. But it's probably different
from what you feel for me.

00:18:59.189 --> 00:19:00.850
That's good enough.

00:19:01.925 --> 00:19:06.692
I'll say it one more time. I won't
take anyone but you to be my consort.

00:19:07.464 --> 00:19:12.333
I was alone for a full year.
It's simply a matter of repeating that.

00:19:12.403 --> 00:19:14.963
But even so, I'm lonely.

00:19:17.474 --> 00:19:19.601
I have but one wish.

00:19:19.677 --> 00:19:22.305
While it can't be helped
in official situations...

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.410
...beyond that, I don't want you
to distance yourself from me.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.915
I don't want you to kneel before me.

00:19:28.419 --> 00:19:31.183
I want you to see me
not as a king but for who I am.

00:19:31.789 --> 00:19:37.284
If you don't, I'll be so sad
and lonely I won't be able to sleep.

00:19:42.633 --> 00:19:45.158
I'm not asking you
to return my feelings...

00:19:45.235 --> 00:19:49.672
...but please don't use my being
king as an excuse to run away.

00:19:50.574 --> 00:19:53.042
You're the one who found
me and made me king.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.578
So running away at this
point would be unfair.

00:19:55.646 --> 00:19:58.547
You were always doing silly things.

00:19:58.615 --> 00:20:00.606
I was always serious.

00:20:02.653 --> 00:20:06.680
Please don't forget,
all I want is you.

00:20:08.092 --> 00:20:11.255
No doubt the person to be loved
by you will be very happy.

00:20:12.029 --> 00:20:15.021
But please give that
happiness to someone else!

00:20:15.866 --> 00:20:19.597
I didn't take the National Exams
to become your wife.

00:20:20.437 --> 00:20:23.463
I came to serve
and support you, below you.

00:20:24.174 --> 00:20:28.611
You are so stubborn. But that's
all right. Because I'm stubborn, too.

00:20:29.713 --> 00:20:33.012
If you fall in love with someone
other than me out there...

00:20:33.617 --> 00:20:36.313
...be sure to contact me
before you get married.

00:20:36.954 --> 00:20:38.478
Why?

00:20:38.555 --> 00:20:42.218
I'll come running,
challenge him to a fight...

00:20:42.292 --> 00:20:44.260
...make you realize again
who's the better man...

00:20:44.328 --> 00:20:46.296
...and break off
your engagement!

00:20:46.997 --> 00:20:49.898
I promise, I'll contact you.

00:20:50.634 --> 00:20:55.594
I won't kneel to you. I won't look
at you through your position as king.

00:21:02.079 --> 00:21:07.984
You'll become a great king.
You'll probably become a great man, too.

00:21:28.472 --> 00:21:31.100
You won't be able to
forget me now, will you?

00:21:31.308 --> 00:21:33.469
Y-You...!

00:21:34.578 --> 00:21:36.341
Please, don't forget.

00:21:37.281 --> 00:21:39.340
That I love you.

00:22:03.006 --> 00:22:05.406
- Wonderful, aren't they?
- Yeah.

00:22:05.476 --> 00:22:10.243
In an instant, she's merged the idea
of woman officials into this court.

00:22:10.747 --> 00:22:12.874
Yes, and so very naturally.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:17.382
In this way she could very well
go on changing various things.

00:22:18.222 --> 00:22:20.190
Quietly, little by little.

00:22:21.091 --> 00:22:23.719
The buds presented
by His Majesty...

00:22:23.794 --> 00:22:25.591
...will bloom, without fail.

00:22:31.268 --> 00:22:33.668
Our heartfelt blessings to you all.

00:22:34.972 --> 00:22:40.410
Ensei Ro. With Yushun Tei,
may you guide them well.

00:22:41.044 --> 00:22:42.170
Yes, sir.

00:22:44.481 --> 00:22:48.212
Seiran Si. May you keep them
from even the slightest harm.

00:22:49.219 --> 00:22:51.653
I swear upon this royal sword,
without fail!

00:22:52.289 --> 00:22:53.813
Eigetsu To.

00:22:53.891 --> 00:22:57.622
As someone pure and not bound to any
previous ties, we are counting on you.

00:22:58.562 --> 00:23:00.530
I will do everything within
my abilities.

00:23:03.066 --> 00:23:04.294
Shurei Hong!

00:23:04.368 --> 00:23:05.426
Yes!

00:23:06.403 --> 00:23:10.806
As a woman, do freely and fully,
all you wish to do.

00:23:11.909 --> 00:23:13.877
As long as this body is able.

00:23:15.112 --> 00:23:19.310
We look forward to the time
the buds you've been given bloom.

00:23:20.884 --> 00:23:24.786
Today, from this moment,
you shall become pillars of this nation!

00:23:30.594 --> 00:23:35.691
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.832 --> 00:23:42.396
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.506 --> 00:23:47.569
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.678 --> 00:23:52.672
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:58.210
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.756 --> 00:24:04.887
You are just like me

00:24:05.629 --> 00:24:10.157
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.233 --> 00:24:16.138
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.107 --> 00:24:22.909
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.013 --> 00:24:27.882
I will always think of you

00:24:29.019 --> 00:24:41.693
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:46.169 --> 00:24:48.271
Next Episode
There's just so much to do getting
ready to leave for Sa Province.

00:24:48.271 --> 00:24:49.206
